// - Stock vehicle lights + lamp texture swap (CPlane::PreRender)
// - Extra ailerons (aileron_l2 / aileron_r2 hinged on aileron2_pos)
// - Alpha-test ref fix for planes / helis / trains / boats
// - Custom exhaust (startup puff + heat haze, optional double)
